#====================================================================
# DRAFT-pico-sdk-pioasm-subdir-application — pico-sdk 只构建 tools/pioasm 子项目
# Source event: pico-sdk 2.2.0 HarmonyOS adaptation, shadow CI PASS on 2026-08-25
#====================================================================

id:                     E426
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|pioasm
phase:                  build|package|testing
error_signature:        PIOASM_VERSION_STRING|PIOASM_GENERATE_PARSER|tools/pioasm|pico_sdk_init.cmake|bare-metal|RP2040|RP2350
severity:               2
category:               cmake, conan, embedded-sdk, host-tool
match_keywords:         pico-sdk, pioasm, tools/pioasm, PIOASM_VERSION_STRING, PIOASM_GENERATE_PARSER, host tool, RP2040, RP2350, bare-metal
title:                 pico-sdk 的 OHOS 包装应优先构建 tools/pioasm host 工具，而不是顶层 RP 固件工程

root_cause:             pico-sdk 顶层 CMake 面向 RP2040/RP2350 固件和裸机 toolchain；直接配置顶层工程会落入硬件平台、target board、外部 submodule 和固件测试逻辑。tools/pioasm 是独立 host-side CMake 子项目，包含已生成 lexer/parser 源码，适合 OHOS-native 构建与 smoke 验证。
affected_scope:         pico-sdk 2.x 及类似“嵌入式 SDK + host-side 工具”项目的 Conan/OHOS 包装。
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/p/pico-sdk/2.2.0 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           cmake-subproject-application-package
rec_description:        Conan recipe 只 configure tools/pioasm，设置 PIOASM_VERSION_STRING=<version>，关闭 PIOASM_GENERATE_PARSER，打包 bin/pioasm 和 share/pico-sdk；test_package 用 pioasm --version 与 .pio->.h 生成校验代表可执行面。
rec_command:            cmake.configure(build_script_folder=os.path.join(self.source_folder, "tools", "pioasm")); cmake.build(build_tool_args=["-j1"])
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      split-full-sdk-features
fallback_description:   若后续需要 USB/Wi-Fi/网络/蓝牙 SDK 功能，不把外部 submodule 混进当前 PR；按 tinyusb/cyw43-driver/lwip/mbedtls/btstack 依赖拆分单独适配。
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          dependency-split

forbid_1_pattern:       cmake.configure\(\)|PICO_BOARD=.*pico|PICO_SDK_FETCH_FROM_GIT
forbid_1_reason:        默认顶层 CMake 会进入 RP 固件平台逻辑或联网获取 submodule，不是 OHOS-native host tool 包装的最小可验范围。
forbid_1_consequence:   构建依赖膨胀、缺少裸机工具链/硬件 SDK 失败，且 PR 混入依赖适配。

principles:             P016
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

